Mechi ya haraka imekwisha.
Tunatoka uwanjani pamoja.
Nimechoka sana.
Kasper na Sara pia wamechoka.
Tunakunywa maji kidogo.
"Unacheza vizuri sana," Sara anasema.
"Asante sana," ninasema.
"Nadhani inafurahisha sana."
"Unacheza mara kwa mara?" Kasper anauliza.
"Ndiyo, ninacheza sana nyumbani Meksiko," ninajibu.
"Huwa ninacheza na dada yangu."
"Ni mchezo wa kufurahisha," Sara anasema.
"Tunapenda kucheza hapa klabuni."
"Ninataka kucheza zaidi hapa Denmaki," ninasema.
"Kweli wewe ni wa haraka," Kasper anacheka.
"Asante, lakini sasa ninataka kukaa chini," ninasema.
"Tuingie kwenye kafeteria?" Kasper anauliza.
"Ndiyo, ningependa sana," ninajibu.
